      "e": 192.85,
      "text": "I wish she was right there."
    },
    {
      "s": 192.85,
      "e": 194.85,
      "text": "We need a smaller flag."
    },
    {
      "s": 194.85,
      "e": 201.81,
      "text": "Yes, it's not."
    },
    {
      "s": 201.81,
      "e": 476.93,
